    "regime_notes": "Full-history 10-day IC and ICIR clear the benchmark gates of absolute IC >= 0.0070 and absolute ICIR >= 0.0840 across the 15-asset universe. The factor is selective, with 47.88% aggregate coverage and about 10.45 names on valid dates. Recent 180/500/750-date results are weak or negative, so recency risk is material; retain only with conservative weighting and ongoing revalidation.",
    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_2_20340807_gated_momentum_signal.csv",
